1. WeSpeaker — speaker-embedding model (diarization)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Component : ResNet34 speaker-embedding architecture + VoxCeleb-trained weights
   Used in   : metal/diar_resnet.zig (independent reimplementation),
               metal/assets/resnet34_diar.bin (format-converted weights)
   Source    : https://github.com/wenet-e2e/wespeaker
   Copyright : Copyright (c) the WeSpeaker authors
   License   : Apache License, Version 2.0  (see THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md §A)
   Changes   : Re-implemented for CPU inference in Zig; BatchNorm folded; weights
               converted to a flat binary. No substantive change to the model.
   Note      : VoxCeleb training data carries its own dataset terms — verify them
               for any commercial/redistribution use of the weights.

