3. DNA3.0-4B — translation + summary/Q&A language model
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Component : DNA3.0-4B (dnotitia) — a Korean-focused post-training of Qwen3.5-4B
   Used in   : on-device live translation + post-session summary / Q&A, run by the
               bundled sovereign Metal LLM engine (Contents/MacOS/translate-engine)
   Source    : https://huggingface.co/dnotitia/DNA3.0-4B
               Base model: https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B (Qwen3, Apache-2.0)
               Downloaded as the i1-Q4_K_M GGUF quant:
               https://huggingface.co/mradermacher/DNA3.0-4B-i1-GGUF
   Copyright : Copyright (c) Dnotitia Inc.; base model (c) Alibaba Cloud (Qwen)
   License   : Apache License, Version 2.0  (see THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md §A)
   Changes   : Weights format-converted to a Q4_K_M GGUF quant; inference runs on an
               independent Zig/Metal engine. No change to architecture or weights.
   Note      : NOT bundled in the app/DMG — downloaded on demand (~2.6 GB) when the
               user turns on translation.

